Edits a text file on the whole screen, a new one when it does not exist

EDIT [[drive:][path]file]
  The arrow keys, Home, End, Page Up and Page Down move, Insert switches between inserting and
  overwriting. ^S saves, ^Q or Escape quits, ^F finds text, ^G goes to a line, ^K cuts the line
  and ^U puts the lines cut last before the cursor's line.
